  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KAIPTC, Koffi Annan International Peace Keeping   Training Centre 2009-2012 - KAIPTC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KAIPTC, Koffi Annan International Peace Keeping   Training Centre 2009-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KAIPTC is an official Regional Peacekeeping Centre for ECOWAS.It has become West Africa&apos;s operational level focus institute for conflict prevention and peace and security studies. It delivers courses to military and civilian personnel involved in Peace Support Operations throughout the world, and leads original and challenging research into the causes and subsequent management of conflict.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KAIPTC &#xE4;r ett officiellt regionalt fredsbevarande Centrum f&#xF6;r ECOWAS.Det har blivit V&#xE4;stafrikas fr&#xE4;msta institut p&#xE5; operationell niv&#xE5; f&#xF6;r konfliktf&#xF6;rebyggande,freds-och s&#xE4;kerhets-studier. KAIPTC har kurser f&#xF6;r afrikansk milit&#xE4;r, polis och civil personal som deltar i fredsbevarande verksamhet i Afrika,och bedriver ocks&#xE5; forskningkring orsakerna och hanterandet av konflikter.</narrative>
  </description>
